WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:29.001
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:33.749 --> 00:00:36.549
摄影师。你是来拍我订婚的。
A photographer. You came to shoot my engagement.

00:00:36.749 --> 00:00:40.049
先生，Harland 把订婚提前了。还有十分钟。
Sir, Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:42.897 --> 00:00:45.197
你：我害的？什么意思？
You: My doing? What do you mean?

00:00:45.297 --> 00:00:51.097
是你。你的气味。
You. Your scent.

00:00:55.345 --> 00:00:59.145
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:01:00.345 --> 00:01:02.145
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:01:05.493 --> 00:01:07.793
你：走到打开的车门前，坐进去。
You: Walk to the open door and get in.

00:01:07.893 --> 00:01:14.693
去吧。我不拦你。
Go ahead. I won't stop you.

00:01:21.941 --> 00:01:24.741
现在我身上都是你的气味。
Your scent is on me now.

00:01:24.941 --> 00:01:27.741
现在别碰我。
Don't touch me right now.

00:01:28.089 --> 00:01:30.389
你：全都告诉我。我们要去哪儿？
You: Tell me everything. Where are we going?

00:01:30.489 --> 00:01:36.289
我的庄园。不远。
My estate. Not far.

00:01:43.037 --> 00:01:46.837
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:47.037 --> 00:01:48.837
让他们来。
Let them.

00:01:50.685 --> 00:01:52.985
你：Selene 是谁？你为什么挂她电话？
You: Who's Selene? Why did you hang up on her?

00:01:53.085 --> 00:01:57.885
她是我的订婚对象。
She's my engagement.

00:01:58.085 --> 00:02:02.885
我选了你。
I chose you.

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:08.933
这是我的领地。
This is my territory.

00:02:10.633 --> 00:02:12.933
会平复的。来。
It'll settle. Come.

00:02:13.281 --> 00:02:15.581
你：牵着他的手走进走廊。
You: Take his hand and walk into the corridor.

00:02:15.681 --> 00:02:21.481
好。跟紧我。
Good. Stay close.

00:02:28.229 --> 00:02:33.029
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就丢下了它。
I walked out on it the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:34.229 --> 00:02:35.529
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:35.877 --> 00:02:38.177
你：我不怕。你只要告诉我接下来会怎样。
You: I'm not scared. Just tell me what happens next.

00:02:38.277 --> 00:02:43.077
你不怕。好。
You're not. Good.

00:02:43.277 --> 00:02:48.077
那就仔细听好。
Then listen carefully.

00:02:48.325 --> 00:02:50.625
先烤火，再回答你。
Fire first. Then answers.

00:02:52.325 --> 00:02:55.125
有人冲你来了。
Someone is coming for you.

00:02:58.473 --> 00:03:00.773
你：站到他身边，面对那扇门。
You: Step beside him and face the door.

00:03:00.873 --> 00:03:06.673
在我身边。好。
Beside me. Fine.

00:03:12.421 --> 00:03:14.721
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:03:15.921 --> 00:03:19.221
她不用你操心，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:03:21.069 --> 00:03:23.369
你：满月时会发生什么？跟我说实话。
You: What happens at the full moon? Tell me the truth.

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:30.269
满月。长老会的期限。
The full moon. The Council's deadline.

00:03:33.517 --> 00:03:36.317
他们冲你来。我不答应。
They come for you. I refuse.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:40.817
你现在怕我了吗？
Are you afraid of me now?

00:03:43.665 --> 00:03:45.965
你：踮起脚吻他。
You: Rise on tiptoe and kiss him.

00:03:46.065 --> 00:03:51.365
过来。
Come here.

00:04:00.613 --> 00:04:03.413
我改主意了。彻底改了。
I changed my mind. Completely.

00:04:03.613 --> 00:04:05.913
那是长老会在召唤。
That's the Council calling.

00:04:06.261 --> 00:04:08.561
你：那声狼嚎……是长老会吗？他们来了？
You: That howl... is that the Council? Are they here?

00:04:08.661 --> 00:04:14.961
还没到。他们在召唤。
Not here yet. They're calling.

00:04:19.709 --> 00:04:23.009
Alpha，Harland 召集了长老。他们今晚就要她。
Alpha. Harland called the elders. They want her tonight.

00:04:24.209 --> 00:04:27.509
那他们会当面听到我的回答。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:04:28.857 --> 00:04:31.157
你：我跟你一起去。
You: I'm coming with you.

00:04:31.257 --> 00:04:37.057
你跟我来。好。
You're coming. Good.

00:04:42.805 --> 00:04:45.105
跟紧我。
Stay close to me.

00:04:48.305 --> 00:04:51.105
他们会看到你。让他们看。
They'll see you. Let them.

00:04:51.453 --> 00:04:53.753
你：答应我，他们带不走我。至少今晚不行。
You: Promise me they won't take me. Not tonight.

00:04:53.853 --> 00:05:00.153
我保证。谁也带不走你。
I promise. Nobody takes you.

00:05:04.901 --> 00:05:07.201
把她交出来，Magnus。
Hand her over, Magnus.

00:05:08.901 --> 00:05:12.201
这条律法今晚作废。她是我的。
The law ends tonight. She is mine.

00:05:14.049 --> 00:05:16.349
你：握住他的手，面对长老们。
You: Take his hand and face the elders.

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:21.749
一起。一直。
Together. Always.

00:05:27.497 --> 00:05:30.797
她是我的 Mate。碰她，就是碰我。
She is my Mate. Touch her, and you touch me.

00:05:30.997 --> 00:05:34.297
你这是向自己的血脉宣战。
You have declared war on your own blood.

00:05:36.645 --> 00:05:38.945
你：这场战争是因为我吗？现在怎么办？
You: Is this war because of me? What happens now?

00:05:39.045 --> 00:05:45.845
不是因为你。是我自己选的。
Not because of you. I chose.

00:05:50.093 --> 00:05:53.893
长老会的期限是满月。
The Council has until the full moon.

00:05:56.593 --> 00:05:58.893
今晚，我们回家。
Tonight, we go home.

00:05:59.241 --> 00:06:01.541
你：上车，坐到他身边。
You: Get in and sit beside him.

00:06:01.641 --> 00:06:07.441
坐。坐我旁边。
Sit. Beside me.

00:06:13.189 --> 00:06:15.989
Arkwright 不会善罢甘休。
Arkwright will not stay quiet.

00:06:18.689 --> 00:06:21.489
留在我身边。一直。
Stay with me. Always.

00:06:21.837 --> 00:06:24.137
你：你拳头攥这么紧。跟我说，怎么了？
You: Your fist is clenched. Talk to me. What's wrong?

00:06:24.237 --> 00:06:30.037
没什么。差不多没事了。
It's nothing. Almost.

00:06:35.285 --> 00:06:38.085
我怕我会失控。
I'm afraid I'll lose control.

00:06:41.285 --> 00:06:44.085
Arkwright 来了。待在我身边。
Arkwright is here. Stay with me.

00:06:44.433 --> 00:06:46.733
你：把他的手按在自己心口
You: Press his hand over your heart

00:06:50.833 --> 00:06:56.633
感觉到了吗？很稳。
Feel that? Steady.

00:06:58.381 --> 00:07:00.681
谁也夺不走这颗心跳。
Nobody takes this heartbeat.

00:07:01.881 --> 00:07:05.181
Arkwright 交给我。别走远。
I'll handle Arkwright. Stay near.
